      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美浦波旁露出好奇的表情陷入思考。\n然而这其实是不需要理清，\n任谁来看都一目了然的事──",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f299bc2e85fb244ee53fbd0b7a8eabad306bf5bb32e7a259a29087dd86395e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
