      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“想要一直看着那样的笑容”、\n“被婴儿的笑容给逗笑了”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d207784073479e252611ad59924d08269e2574fb439c883bc1ff7b4c1b693d1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
